+    "From #2628 (R10-FLOW-PULL), review 6fc4c91ab: nudge.md step 16 holds a ready critical-path group behind its flow-lane cap and the pr_cap.py dispatch-gate WIP total. That contradicts tvofi's 2026-10-22 rulings (\"ready critical-path groups are exempt from the open-PR soft cap\", \"remember critical path groups starts regardless off the caps when ready\"). nudge.md step 16 must also state that a ready critical-path group (a member of the plan's critical_path, every after group done) is dispatched regardless of its lane cap and the WIP total, via pr_cap.py dispatch-gate --over-cap \"critical path: <group>\", and name the same --over-cap route for expedite items. Control: no sentence in nudge.md or orchestrator.md conditions a ready critical-path dispatch on any cap."
